📰 AI News Summarizer & Telegram Notifier

A fully automated system that fetches trending news, summarizes it using AI, and sends it directly to Telegram every 6 hours.

This project uses Flowise, JavaScript, and Telegram Bot API to create a smart automated news delivery system. It fetches the latest articles, extracts relevant details, summarizes them using an LLM, optionally selects a representative image, and sends everything neatly to a Telegram chat or channel.

It works 24/7 without manual intervention.

🚀 Features

Automatic News Fetching — pulls latest news from websites or APIs.

Smart Article Extraction — cleans up titles, descriptions, images, and URLs.

AI Summarization — uses LLM (Groq/OpenAI/etc.) in Flowise to generate short, clear summaries.

Telegram Notifications — sends summaries to a Telegram chat using sendMessage or sendPhoto.

Image Selection (optional) — custom logic to pick an article image or fallback placeholder.

Scheduled Automation — triggers every 6 hours using cron + Flowise webhook.

Error Handling — skips broken articles and handles missing images smoothly.

Fully No-Code / Low-Code — almost everything is built visually in Flowise.

🧩 Tech Stack

Flowise AI (visual AI agent builder)

JavaScript / Node.js

Telegram Bot API

Cron (Debian) — for scheduling

Optional: Custom JS Functions inside Flowise
